WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.490 --> 00:00:01.400
- [Host] Every morning,

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:04.300
thousands of dogs wake up not for a day of barks and naps,

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:05.283
but to work.

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:08.190
More than half a million people rely on a service dog

00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:11.640
in their everyday lives, but these are no ordinary pups.

00:00:12.049 --> 00:00:15.470
A dog's journey from carefree puppy to hero is a long one

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:19.310
filled with trials, triumphs, and setbacks.

00:00:20.210 --> 00:00:22.700
It takes months and years to train these elite dogs

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:24.650
for all the rigors of service dog life,

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:27.910
and not all puppies that begin the process will graduate.

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.220
Follow along as a handful of puppies

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:33.910
go through a month of training, obstacles, and field trips

00:00:34.370 --> 00:00:36.720
all to get just that much closer to graduation.

00:00:37.485 --> 00:00:40.310
^There's steady Deacon, charismatic Luke,

00:00:40.830 --> 00:00:44.360
^shy Benelli, confident Kaya, wilcard Remmy,

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:47.990
^and, of course, the undeniable Mr. Pip.

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:51.040
Do any of these puppies have the smarts and spirit

00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:52.390
to pass service dog school?

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:55.360
Find out in Puppy Prep.

00:00:56.184 --> 00:00:59.351
(inspirational music)

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:02.780
(birds chirping)

